1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,051
The Angstrom Assistant answers questions about the app,

2
00:00:03,071 --> 00:00:05,548
and helps you turn an idea into a test.

3
00:00:05,598 --> 00:00:09,845
Open it with the AI button at the top right, or beside the Lattice tabs.

4
00:00:10,291 --> 00:00:12,543
It opens in its own window beside the app,

5
00:00:12,563 --> 00:00:15,135
so it never covers what you're working on.

6
00:00:15,562 --> 00:00:17,697
Ask anything, in your own words.

7
00:00:18,127 --> 00:00:21,243
Here, an idea about breakouts that lose their volume.

8
00:00:25,562 --> 00:00:28,593
It answers with the steps, using the app's own names.

9
00:00:28,643 --> 00:00:32,655
It knows your saved Groups and Sets, and links the video that shows it.

10
00:00:33,095 --> 00:00:36,915
Stuck on a screen? Paste a screenshot, or drop one on the window.

11
00:01:02,083 --> 00:01:04,026
and ask what you're looking at.

12
00:01:08,312 --> 00:01:10,489
It explains, and you do the clicks.

13
00:01:10,539 --> 00:01:12,930
It never makes buy or sell calls.

14
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:16,565
These answers are examples; yours depend on your question.
